  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2 div (1)/(5) of (4+4 div 2)+[(1)/(2) div (25)/(4)-4]\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/694d0d67bc14effd3a3679b70b4d77edef851107a6a53b64ea488e47e4c2bef5.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n2 div (1)/(5) of (4+4 div 2)+[(1)/(2) div (25)/(4)-4]\n\n⇒ 2 div (1)/(5) of (4+2)+[(1)/(2) div (25)/(4)-4]\n\n⇒ 2 div (1)/(5) of 6+[(1)/(2) div (25)/(4)-4]\n\n⇒ 2 div (1)/(5) of 6+[(1)/(2) times (4)/(25)-4]\n\n⇒ 2 div (1)/(5) of 6+[ (2)/(25)-4]\n\n⇒ 2 div (1)/(5) of 6+[ (2 - 100)/(25)]\n\n⇒ 2 div (1)/(5) of 6- (98)/(25)\n\n⇒ 2 div (6)/(5)- (98)/(25)\n\n⇒ 2 times (5)/(6)- (98)/(25)\n\n⇒ (5)/(3)- (98)/(25)\n\n⇒ (125 -294)/(75)\n\n⇒ -(169)/(75)\n\n**∴ Required answer is -(169)/(75).**",
